extends layout.pug

block content

  article.portfolio-intro

    h1 Andres Saenz FullStack JavaScript Portfolio

    p Passionate Full-Stack JavaScript Developer driven by an absolute fascination with technology. I love building seamless web applications from front to back and turning complex ideas into elegant, modern solutions.


  article.portfolio-project-thumbs
    .projects-box.box.grid

      each project in data
        .cell
          a(href= `project/${project.id}`)
            img.thumbnail(src=project.image_urls[0], alt=project.title)
            h5= project.name

  


